e\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I take the bus around 9 a.m. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> from ... to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn1le04ob10img04.png\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Every morning I drive from 9 to 10. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example Dialogue</span>: <br /><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I get to work before 9:00 every day. \u00a0<br /> <span class=\"strong\">Theresa</span>: I usually get to the office after 10:00 a.m. <br /><span class=\"strong\">Nancy</span>: We arrive around 9:00. <br /> <span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>: Lunch break is from 1:00 to 2:00 every day. </span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "early", "type": "name"}, {"content": "before a specific time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I take the 7 a.m. bus because I like to get to the office early.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le04ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about time.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "late", "type": "name"}, {"content": "after a specific time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My bus usually leaves late, so I get to work after 10 a.m. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le04ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "on time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "at a specific time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I get to the office on time every morning, at exactly 9 a.m.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le04ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "before", "type": "name"}, {"content": "at a time earlier than a specific time ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(preposition)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to arrive early at the office, so I get up before 7 a.m.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le04ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "after", "type": "name"}, {"content": "at a time later than a specific time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(preposition)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I get home after 6 p.m. because there is always a lot of traffic.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le04ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "around", "type": "name"}, {"content": "close to a specific time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(preposition)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I usually get to the office on time, around 9 a.m.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le04ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to get to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to arrive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What time do you get to the office in the morning?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le04ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "coffee break", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a short rest from work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to take a coffee break after 10:00 a.m.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le04ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Express information about  daily or weekly routine in a very simple way.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Speaks in English about daily routines with a limited range of vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn1le04ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, discuss your daily routine.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compare your routine with your partner's. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present the routines to the class or teacher.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about my daily routine. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I compare my daily routine with my partner's. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}